<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Times+New+Roman:wght@400;700&amp;display=swap');

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
            line-height: 1.4;
            font-size: 14px;
            max-width: 100%;
            background: #f9f9f9;
        }

        .page {
            width: 8.5in;
            min-height: 11in;
            margin: 30px auto;
            background: white;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
        }

        .page-content {
            padding: 0.75in 1in;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 18px;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        p {
            text-align: justify;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .center {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .placeholder {
            border: 2px dashed #999;
            background: #f5f5f5;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #666;
        }

        .two-column {
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .column {
            flex: 1;
        }

        ul, ol {
            margin-left: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        /* Signature line simulation */
        .sig-line {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            width: 200px;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }

        /* Header block */
        .header-block {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .footer {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 30px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 10px;
            color: #666;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div class="page-content">
            <!-- Title Block -->
            <div class="header-block">
                <h1>RESEARCH PAPER TITLE</h1>
                <p style="font-size:16px; margin-bottom:10px;">Author Name<br>
                Affiliation<br>
                Date</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Abstract -->
            <div style="text-align:center; margin-bottom:30px;">
                <strong>Abstract</strong><br>
                [Abstract text goes here – typically 150–250 words summarizing the research problem, methods, key findings, and conclusions.]
            </div>

            <!-- Introduction -->
            <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
            <p>Welcome to the introduction section. This paper explores [topic]. The background and motivation are presented here.</p>

            <!-- Literature Review -->
            <h2>2. Literature Review</h2>
            <p>In this section, a comprehensive review of existing literature is provided.</p>

            <!-- Methods -->
            <h2>3. Methods</h2>
            <p style="font-size:12px;">[Methodology description – experimental setup, data collection, etc.]</p>

            <!-- Results -->
            <h2>4. Results</h2>
            <div class="placeholder" style="width:80%; height:250px; margin:20px auto;">
                [Chart: Bar chart showing experimental results – centered]
            </div>
            <p>Key results are summarized as follows:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Finding 1: [illegible data]</li>
                <li>Finding 2: [illegible data]</li>
            </ul>

            <!-- Discussion -->
            <h2>5. Discussion</h2>
            <p>The implications of the results are discussed here.</p>

            <!-- Conclusion -->
            <h2>6. Conclusion</h2>
            <p>In conclusion, the study has achieved [key outcome]. Future work is suggested.</p>

            <!-- References -->
            <h2>References</h2>
            <ol style="list-style-type:decimal;">
                <li>Author, A. (Year). Title of the paper. Journal, volume(issue), pages.</li>
                <li>Author, B. (Year). Another title. Publisher.</li>
            </ol>

            <!-- Signature -->
            <div style="margin-top:100px; text-align:right;">
                <p>Prepared by: [Author Name]</p>
                <div class="sig-line"></div>
                <p>Date: [Date]</p>
            </div>

            <div class="footer">
                Page 1 of 1 • Confidential
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
